ak"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は乃木中！\n明日はNOGIBINGO！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も良き日をm(._.)m"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-32459":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/05/29/8023410/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/05/29/8023410/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いきなりですが、\n皆さんに報告がありまーす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/05/29/8023410/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"井上家に家族が増えました(﹡ˆˆ﹡)！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ででーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/05/29/8023410/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アメリカンショートヘアの子猫です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/05/29/8023410/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以前から、実家で飼っているポメラニアンの\nリーくんのお友達を探していて、\nついに この子に決まりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲良くしてくれたらいいなあ(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とは言え、中々実家に帰ることが出来ず、\nまだ私はこの子に会えてないんです...(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は、お母さんから送られてくる\n写真たちに、毎日癒されてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く会いたいなあ ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台「じょしらく弐～時かけそば～」\n全公演が終了致しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご観劇下さった皆さま、\n有難うございました(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落語楽しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「チームく」で本当によかった！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/05/29/8023410/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいか、ちーちゃん、みりあ、ことこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しすぎました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイペースすぎました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鍋パも楽しかったし、\nこないだもまた私のお家に集まって、\nお泊まり会しました～\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで買出しして、ご飯作って食べて\nいっぱいお話してほんと楽しかった！\nこのチームだいすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、カメラマン役のめぐたん！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/05/29/8023410/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲良くなって、こないだは\n2人で映画観てきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/05/29/8023410/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/05/29/8023410/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画始まる前から笑いすぎて\n苦しかった～～（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度は一緒に舞台も観に行く\\( ˆoˆ )/わー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演出の川尻さん、演助の西岡ねぇさん、\n音楽のあらいさん、振り付けの竹森さん、\n落語の枝太郎さん、アンサンブルの皆さま...\n沢山の携わって下さった方々、\nすべての方に感謝です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また一緒にお仕事できますように。\n有難うございました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{